            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Definition",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==this== is decided by HOW a function is called: the **call-site**",
                "Not by where the function is defined",
                "{orange:Arrow} functions are the exception: lexical `this`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Default and Implicit",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Plain `fn()` is {red:default}: `this = globalThis` in sloppy mode",
                "Strict mode gives `undefined`; modules and classes are always strict",
                "`obj.fn()` sets `this = obj`",
                "Only the object ==immediately left of the dot== counts"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "javascript",
              "lines": [
                "const a = { b: { n: 'b', fn() { return this.n } } }",
                "a.b.fn()  // 'b': this is b, not a"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Comparison",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
